    advanced: "MisÃ¨re Defense: If an opponent bids MisÃ¨re, your team must work together to 'Force' them to win a trick. Lead suits where you have many low cards. If you see the MisÃ¨re player stalling on a suit (e.g., they play a 7 when you lead a 4), they are afraid of that suit. Lead it again! Defense against MisÃ¨re is about 'Hand-Squeezing' the bidder until they have no choice but to take a trick.",
